 gray:"60 20Y man with fever, sore throat for 4 days แล้วมีfatigue, dark urine GA: mildly pale, no jaundice CBC: Hb ต่ำ , WBC normal, Platelet normal PBS ให้ภาพมา เจอ Hb contracted cell, ghost cell, leakage cell, band form, NRC — A. G6PD assay B. Hb typing C. OF test D. Direct Coomb E. BM study",
 opts:["G6PD assay","Hb typing","OF test","Direct Coomb","BM study"],ans:0,key:"A G6PD assay"+KS,
